    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Trade</p><p>Mannequins for armor, hooks for Shields, racks for weapons, and chests of ammunition.</p><p><strong>Trade: Stock Armory.</strong> The hireling stocks the Armory with armor, Shields, weapons, and ammunition, for 100 GP plus 100 GP per Bastion Defender in your Bastion (half the total if your Bastion has a Smithy).</p><p>While your Armory is stocked, your Bastion Defenders are harder to kill: when an event makes you roll dice to see whether your Bastion loses defenders, roll 1d8 instead of each d6. When the event is over, the equipment is expended, whatever the number of defenders you had or lost, until you issue another Trade order and pay to restock it.</p>",
